---
import CtaBtn from '../website/cta-btn.astro';
---

<section>
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <div class="container pt-5 pb-5">
            
            <div class="grid">
                
                <div class="col-mobile-12 col-8 pr-5">
                    <h2>This is how Zin Works</h2>

                    <h5>
                        Three simple steps. No blank page.
                    </h5>
                    <p class="text-bold">
                        <i class="bi bi-star-fill txt-orange mr-2"></i>
                        Capture the thought while it's there
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        After a client call, or a conversation, or an inspired thought, open Zin and type. A sentence, a paragraph or a quick thought. That's a Zin. It took less than 30 seconds.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-bold">
                        <i class="bi bi-star-fill txt-orange mr-2"></i>
                        Open Zin when you are ready to write
                    </p>
                    <p>
Browse your Zins by keyword, tag or date. The thinking is already there, you just need to select the the Zins that feel relevant. Combine them with one of our ready-made prompts. Add into whatever AI tool you use. Watch what happens when the input is genuinely yours.
                    </p>

                    <p class="text-bold">
                        <i class="bi bi-star-fill txt-orange mr-2"></i>
                        A growing library of your own thinking, ready to be turned into content
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Every Zin you capture builds a private collection of ideas, stories and insights that is entirely and unmistakably you. Over time, content creation stops being a battle and starts being a simple process.
                    </p>
                    
                </div>

                <div class="col-mobile-12 col-4">
                    <img src="https://xo8h-rjxb-rsw5.e2.xano.io/vault/tGsoI1Ml/f4SPO1ZjUBOaXzjj3SUt9NVuq48/znX0-A../jess-morgan-nTVdm_vEJQc-unsplash.webp"
                    class="img-responsive-rounded img-border" alt="zin app solution image"
                    />
                </div>
                
            </div>

            <div class="grid mt-5" style="border: #4ecdc4;border-style: solid;border-width: 1px;" >
                <div class="col-mobile-12 col-12 text-center mt-5 pb-5 pl-2 pr-2">
                    <h4>
                        In an age of AI, authenticity is your <em>strategic advantage</em>
                    </h4>

                    <p>
                        Your experiences, your ideas, your inspirations are those that will make the difference.  
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <i class="bi bi-arrow-right-square-fill txt-orange mr-2"></i> Try Zin today and build content that LinkedIn will love.
                    </p>

                    <CtaBtn subtext="Amplify your voice now - get Zin." />

                </div>
            </div>
            
        </div>
    </div>
</section>